																			<div class="sc-feature-tile__title"><p>Money Safe protects your bank savings from scams</p>
</div>
																												<div class="sc-feature-tile__description"><p>Funds Locked under Money Safe will be restricted from fund outflow via any channels and transaction types, preventing scammers to access and transfer out the funds.</p>
</div>
